<title>SINGAPORE: Bangchak awards Sep MTBE buy tender at $285-$290/T.</title>
<headline>Bangchak awards Sep MTBE buy tender at $285-$290/T.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thailand's Bangchak Petroleum Plc has awarded its September methyl tertiary butyl ether (MTBE) buy tender at $285 to $290 per tonne to Saudi Basic Industries Corp (SABIC), a company source said on Friday.</p>
<p>The award for 1,500 tonnes of the gasoline octane booster, was on a cost-and-freight basis to Thailand for delivery September 1-15.</p>
<p>The tender closed on August 13 and offers were valid to August 14.</p>
<p>In its last tender, Bangchak also bought a cargo from SABIC, for August delivery at around $275 per tonne, c-and-f.</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom (+65 870 3093)</p>
